{"id":"franco","lemma":"franco","pos":"adj","rank":2647,"glosses":["frank, candid, straightforward","generous, liberal, openhanded","free, unimpeded, unencumbered"],"ipa":"/ˈfɾanko/","forms":{"feminine":"franca","masculinePlural":"francos","femininePlural":"francas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1e/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-franco.wav","examples":[{"text":"Para ser franco, no te queda.","en":"Frankly speaking, it doesn't suit you.","words":[{"g":"for"},{"g":"to be"},null,{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"curfew"}]},{"text":"¡Sea usted franco conmigo!","en":"Be frank with me!","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"you (formal)"},null,{"g":"with me"}]},{"text":"Se estableció un puerto franco.","en":"A free port was established.","words":[{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to establish","l":"establecer"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"port, harbour"},null]},{"text":"Él es una persona franca con la que se puede hablar fácilmente.","en":"He is a frank person and easy to talk to.","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"person (an individual"},null,{"g":"with"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"that"},null,null,{"g":"to talk"},{"g":"easily"}],"phrases":[[8,10,"may I?"]]},{"text":"Para serte franco, así es como sucedió.","en":"To tell the truth, this is how it happened.","words":[{"g":"for"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,null,null,{"g":"as"},{"g":"to happen","l":"suceder"}],"phrases":[[3,5,"so it is: so it goes"]]}]}